Looking at the sequence: the camera wearer spreads foil on the counter and arranges the washed mushrooms (and later tomatoes) on it. Near the end of the video (around 14:20–14:35), the black baking tray is positioned and slid underneath that foil sheet with the mushrooms on it. Then the whole stack—black tray with the foil-covered mushrooms on top of it—is lifted and placed into the open oven, and the oven door is closed, so both go in together.

This matches option C: the black tray was slid under the foil-covered mushroom tray (to catch drips) and both went into the oven together.

{"answer": "C"}
